WEBVTT

00:05:29.385 --> 00:05:31.258
"I love other people!"

00:05:31.282 --> 00:05:32.439
Don't get me wrong --

00:05:32.463 --> 00:05:34.087
I'm actually not a people person.

00:05:34.111 --> 00:05:37.476
(Laughter)

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.052
I don't really love other people --

00:05:40.076 --> 00:05:41.096
(Laughter)

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:42.746
But I love computers,

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.985
I love interacting with other
people on email,

00:05:45.009 --> 00:05:48.341
because it kind of gives you that buffer.

00:05:48.365 --> 00:05:54.866
But I do love other people who comment
and get involved in my project.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.543
And it made it so much more.

00:05:57.273 --> 00:06:00.107
CA: So was there a moment
when you saw what was being built